      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789669431184,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Cohesion - how well things go together.\n\n1. Accidental \n    - the \"junk drawer\" of programming: a utils directory.\n    - extension methods, etc.\n\n\n2. Temporal\n    - When you use it\n    - Rates of Change\n        - Keep things together that change together*\n\n\n3. Functional\n    - Keep the stuff you use close together.\n    - Probably the \"best\", most common.\n\n4. Type\n    This is the tightest coupling. When a thing is a type of another \nthing (inheritance).\nSee \"fragile base class problem\", etc. \n\"Prefer Composition over Inheritance\"\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Cohesion - how well things go together.\n\n1. Accidental \n    - the \"junk drawer\" of programming: a utils directory.\n    - extension methods, etc.\n\n\n2. Temporal\n    - When you use it\n    - Rates of Change\n        - Keep things together that change together*\n\n\n3. Functional\n    - Keep the stuff you use close together.\n    - Probably the \"best\", most common.\n\n4. Type\n    This is the tightest coupling. When a thing is a type of another \nthing (inheritance).\nSee \"fragile base class problem\", etc. \n\"Prefer Composition over Inheritance\"\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
