      "text": "Bank:\n    - We are going to have \"Gold Accounts\". Gold accounts will get a bonus\n      applied to every deposit. Right now we are thinking 10%.\n    - However, we aren't quite sure what the requirements to be a gold account are yet.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Bank:\n    - We are going to have \"Gold Accounts\". Gold accounts will get a bonus\n      applied to every deposit. Right now we are thinking 10%.\n    - However, we aren't quite sure what the requirements to be a gold account are yet.",
